{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>To bring out the lice.</b> Midrash: because the lice separate between the feet of the sorcerers and the ground, and sorcery is effective only when the feet of the sorcerer reach the earth, as is related in the episode of Shimon ben Shetach, where the young men lifted the sorceresses off the ground. And three of the plagues came through Aaron — דצ\"ך were smitten in the earth; בא\"ח through Moses, for they came from the heavens, as he had dominion over heaven and earth; and three through the Holy One, blessed be He; and boils came through all three of them."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:50.232288931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}